==Battleground==
*1 [[Shibalien Elite]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*2 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*2 [[Shibalien Elite]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[General GreGory]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Crustaceous Scissorex]] spawns as the boss.
**6 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**5 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.
**2 [[General GreGory|General GreGories]] spawn, delay 50~53.33 seconds<sup>1,500f~1,600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Shibalien Elite]]s spawn, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Bring [[Ancient Egg: N001 (Special Cat)|Haniwa Cat]] and [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Catellite]] as meatshields, as well as [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] for massive damage against the behemoths of this stage. [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] and other rushers do well to brute force their way into Crustaceous Scissorex's attack range. Make sure to bring other anti-Aliens like [[Psychocat (Rare Cat)|Psychocat]] or [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]] for General GreGory and Crustaceous Scissorex.

